            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2、微分方程LTIS判断—反证法"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                162,
                436,
                178
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3、双零法视角下LTIS判断"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                186,
                400,
                201
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(1)完全响应是零输入和零状态的线性组合，呈现可分解性；"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                183,
                211,
                655,
                226
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(2)仅与0_状态相关的部分为零输入响应，其与0_状态呈现线性；"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                235,
                694,
                252
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(3)仅与激励相关的零状态响应与激励呈线性时不变。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                260,
                601,
                277
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "例22：某连续系统的全响应为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y(t) = lgf(0) + \\int_0^t f(\\tau)d\\tau"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "，试判断线性时不变？"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                308,
                801,
                325
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "例 23：设系统的初始状态为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "x(0)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "，激励为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "f(\\cdot)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "，各系统的全响应  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y(\\cdot)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 与激励和初始状态的关系如下，试分析各系统是否是线性时不变的。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                183,
                488,
                810,
                529
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(1)  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y(t)=e^{-t}x(0)+\\int_{0}^{t}\\sin xf(x)dx"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ;"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                538,
                468,
                558
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(2)  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y(t)=\\sin[x(0)t]+\\int_{0}^{t}f(x)dx"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 。"
                    }
                ]
            },
