                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "考点 3: LTIS双零法视角下响应求解"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                109,
                527,
                125
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "原理：①零输入与初始状态呈线性关系 ②零状态与激励呈线性和时不变关系。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                138,
                791,
                154
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "例 24: 已知一线性时不变系统, 在相同初始条件下, 当激励为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "e(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 时, 其全响应为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "r_1(t) = [2e^{-3t} + \\sin(2t)]u(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "; 当激励为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "2e(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 时, 其全响应为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "r_2(t) = [e^{-3t} + 2\\sin(2t)]u(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 。求:"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                184,
                810,
                254
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(1)初始条件不变，当激励为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "e(t-t_{0})"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 时的全响应  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "r_{3}(t), t_{0}>0;"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                261,
                670,
                277
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
